  "description": "In an era of 10 million single-person households, a story about lovingly tending to one’s own little universe. \n\nBecause I am my own caregiver, educator, and guardian. Today, too, Luna feeds, teaches, and protects herself. Single-person living that overcomes rental scams, Single-person economic life as a freelancer, Single-person hobbies that brighten everyday life... Luna’s private universe is filled once again today with tiny, sparkling moments. \n\nA heartfelt song of encouragement from Luna to all those living solo who quietly orbit and protect their own universe.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
